{"4191400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Bonds", "steam_appid": 4191400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying within the space of traditional <strong>Action</strong> Role Playing / <strong>Adventure</strong> games, Shattered Bonds provides a unique combat experience, adding a fresh wind to the core gameplay of an already widely popular genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Companion based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on a <strong>companion</strong> based combat style, where the player can control these companions indirectly as well as directly, through the use of abilities. This enhances personal combat preferences and gives the opportunity to adjust strategies in moment-to-moment gameplay, leading to a unique mix of action and strategic combat, requiring both quick and tactical decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will learn how to <strong>fight</strong> and <strong>defend</strong> yourself, <strong>recruit</strong> new companions and lead them towards victory.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While staying within the space of traditional <strong>Action</strong> Role Playing / <strong>Adventure</strong> games, Shattered Bonds provides a unique combat experience, adding a fresh wind to the core gameplay of an already widely popular genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Companion based combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on a <strong>companion</strong> based combat style, where the player can control these companions indirectly as well as directly, through the use of abilities. This enhances personal combat preferences and gives the opportunity to adjust strategies in moment-to-moment gameplay, leading to a unique mix of action and strategic combat, requiring both quick and tactical decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will learn how to <strong>fight</strong> and <strong>defend</strong> yourself, <strong>recruit</strong> new companions and lead them towards victory.</p>", "short_description": "Shattered Bonds is an Action/Adventure Role Playing Game, where only the bonds between you and your companions hold meaning. In order to survive in this dark fantasy world, you will unleash powerful ultimates to carve your path through ever-changing dungeons and challenge enemies and fate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191400/0094cbc7ea494d9359609cd0fa33f7facd6baa5d/header.jpg?t=1769370387", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191400/c996695f1a8dfe58e8dc3149afb3042c4d71bda9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769370387", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191400/c996695f1a8dfe58e8dc3149afb3042c4d71bda9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769370387", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD CPU at 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11/12 compatible GPU with 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</str